slurm_jobs/
docs/

# --- results/: ignore everything except the figures we ship ---
results/*
!results/city_growth.gif
!results/city_growth.png
!results/top10_alpha_sweep.json
!results/top10_alpha_sweep_evolution.pdf
!results/top10_alpha_sweep_gap.pdf
